<item name='HelpECategories'><text>2. Database Custodian Guide</text></item>
<item name='HelpESubCat'><text>New Fiscal Year!</text></item>
<item name='HelpFCategories'><text>2. Guide de gardien de base de données</text></item>
<item name='HelpFSubCat'><text>Nouvelle Année Fiscale!</text></item>
<item name='HelpDocNumber'><number>1</number></item>
<item name='HelpSubCatNumber'><number>4</number></item>
<item name='HelpEHelpText'><richtext>
<pardef id='1' align='center' leftmargin='0.8125in' rightmargin='75%'/>
<par def='1'><run><font size='14pt' name='Arial Black' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20' color='green'/>Updated on 2009-08-06</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font size='14pt' name='Arial Black' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20' color='green'/>Closing the Fiscal Year &amp;</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font size='14pt' name='Arial Black' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20' color='green'/>Starting a New One</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font size='14pt' name='Arial Black' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20' color='green'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font size='14pt' style='underline shadow' name='Arial Black'
 pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20' color='green'/>What To Do in HECS Orders Database</run></par>
<pardef id='2' leftmargin='0.8125in' rightmargin='75%'/>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font style='bold underline' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/>1. Rolling over the numbers</run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font style='bold underline' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>The reference numbers will rollover automatically - DO NOTHING</run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>The orders below were created in Fiscal Year 2005-2006, so the reference number begins with ITA-05.</run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>When April 1 2006 rolls around, the next order will be labelled ITA-060001</run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
