><font style='bold underline' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20' color='green'/></run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'
 color='green'/></run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'
 color='green'/>	2.2.2 Enter the new budget information, as provided by the Section Head.</run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'
 color='green'/>	</run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'
 color='green'/>	2.2.2.1 If the project is being discontinued, DO NOT DELETE it.  Simply set the budget to zero, and remove all names from the list of Employees.</run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'
 color='green'/></run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'
 color='green'/>	2.2.2 If the project budget information is not available - ask the Section Head what to do.</run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'
 color='green'/></run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'
 color='green'/>	2.2.3 Press Recalculate Budget</run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'
 color='green'/></run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'
 color='green'/>	2.2.4 Save and exit</run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par></richtext></item>
